@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@playerId = 0192f28f-5dc0-7d58-bdb2-814ad6a0f4a1
@walletId = replace-with-wallet-id-from-create-response

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Readiness (requires PostgreSQL and LocalStack SQS)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Create wallet: should return 201, balance 100.00, version 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerId": "{{playerId}}",
  "initialBalance": { "amount": "100.00", "currency": "BRL" }
}

### BET: should return 200, balance 75.00
POST {{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions
Idempotency-Key: smoke:bet-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "providerId": "smoke-provider",
  "externalTransactionId": "bet-001",
  "playerId": "{{playerId}}",
  "walletId": "{{walletId}}",
  "roundId": "round-001",
  "gameId": "smoke-game",
  "kind": "BET",
  "money": { "amount": "25.00", "currency": "BRL" }
}

### Exact replay: same transactionId and original balance 75.00; idempotentReplay true
POST {{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions
Idempotency-Key: smoke:bet-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "providerId": "smoke-provider",
  "externalTransactionId": "bet-001",
  "playerId": "{{playerId}}",
  "walletId": "{{walletId}}",
  "roundId": "round-001",
  "gameId": "smoke-game",
  "kind": "BET",
  "money": { "amount": "25.00", "currency": "BRL" }
}

### Same key, different payload: should return 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions
Idempotency-Key: smoke:bet-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "providerId": "smoke-provider",
  "externalTransactionId": "bet-001",
  "playerId": "{{playerId}}",
  "walletId": "{{walletId}}",
  "roundId": "round-001",
  "gameId": "smoke-game",
  "kind": "BET",
  "money": { "amount": "30.00", "currency": "BRL" }
}

### Wallet query
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{walletId}}

### Ledger query
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{walletId}}/ledger?limit=50

### Reconciliation: consistent should be true
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{walletId}}/reconciliation
